            "review_title": "Review at King BBQ Vivo City Dist.7",
            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary21025 contributions\n1\nKorean BBQ 🍗 for dinner\nJan 2024 • Business\nLocated in VIVOCITY shopping mall in district 7. It is Korean restaurant chain in whole Saigon, more Korean BBQ fast food concept. You grill meat 🥩 fish 🐠 🌽 offering bar with dips, toppings and sauces for salat wrap. 🍺 or 💧 beside other smoothies or sweet drinks 🥤. We were sitting at biggest tables which were pretty closed to sofa 🛋️\nWritten January 23, 2024",
